<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Thermo Electron a neutral.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Thermo Electron a neutral.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it initiated coverage of Thermo Electron Corp with a neutral rating.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 3/8 to 31-1/2 in morning New York Stock Exchange trade.</p>
